cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "tpscaling: extreme precipitation-temperature scaling over the Tibetan Plateau"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for estimating and classifying extreme precipitation-temperature
  scaling by temperature-percentile binning, including LOESS-based detection of
  peak structures and classification into negative, sub-C-C, C-C and super-C-C
  scaling regimes.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FemiPeter/tpscaling"
authors:
  - family-names: Olowe
    given-names: Jesufemi
keywords:
  - extreme precipitation
  - Clausius-Clapeyron scaling
  - Tibetan Plateau
  - quantile regression
